(text "BBB P9.21 (UART2 TX) via J5.9" (at 60.96 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b97464a6-89f0-4b0e-9b4a-1ea7784ff0f6"))
(text "BBB P9.22 (UART2 RX) via J5.7" (at 60.96 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "01196222-82a5-4dd9-82d9-be1b1292c99f"))
(text "J2.9 -> GX5 pin 4 (RS-232 RxD)" (at 166.37 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f11013bc-1cf6-4e23-a379-301f4405d621"))
(text "J2.8 <- GX5 pin 5 (RS-232 TxD)" (at 166.37 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "676fdc30-9916-4554-a560-c04c3d52d927"))
(text "3.3 V logic" (at 88.9 92.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25d22018-1094-4e6d-b446-026c611b4318"))
(text "RS-232 levels (about +/-5.5 V)" (at 160.02 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a4471a58-2e79-4dbd-8a41-297448e66960"))
(text "IMU: MicroStrain 3DM-GX5-AHRS (off-board, harness on J2)" (at 40.64 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3d249224-d276-46b8-97b0-b296e2dc4c14"))
(text "Converts the BBB's 3.3 V UART2 (unchanged through J5) to the RS-232 levels the GX5 needs.\nHarness: J2 (Harwin M80 2x5) to GX5 micro-D 9. Only one GX5 interface may be wired, so USB (pins 1/2) stays open." (at 40.64 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4069d348-29b0-4be7-a873-7ea032486479"))
(text "Notes\n1. U10 runs from +3V3 so ROUT can never put more than 3.3 V on BBB P9.22, which is not 5 V tolerant.\n2. FORCEON and FORCEOFF (active low) are tied high, so auto-powerdown is off and the driver to the GX5 never sleeps.\n3. C26 to C29 are 0.1 uF per the TI table for VCC = 3.3 V +/-0.3 V. V+ and V- reach about +/-6.6 V, so use 16 V or higher.\n4. READY and INVALID are unused.\n5. Place U10 and C26 to C30 within about 10 mm of J2. Keep the RS-232 traces short and away from the USB pairs." (at 40.64 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f235ca7-7c28-4639-879e-d30835d85654"))
