	(text "J2: harness to GX5 micro-D 9 (Omnetics A98100-009 pigtail)\nJ2.1 IMU_5V_SW (switched +5V) -> GX5 3 (+4 to +5.5 V input)\nJ2.5 GNDD -> GX5 8\nJ2.7 IMU_PPS -> GX5 7 (PPS in)\nJ2.8 <- GX5 5 (RS-232 TxD)\nJ2.9 -> GX5 4 (RS-232 RxD)\nJ2.10 GNDD (spare, shield drain)\nJ2.2, 3, 4, 6: not used by the GX5"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d357b9a6-2a72-4593-9112-205738dd2883")
	)
	(text "PPS: GNSS VPP (J4.19, 3.3 V, ~500 us) also goes to J5.27 / BBB.\nR17 limits back-feed while the GX5 is unpowered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "301b94f0-b12b-4800-9274-aaee5d70f420")
	)
	(text "J2 supply (IMU_5V_SW): C9, C11 decoupling, C32 bulk, D6 TVS"
