	(text "R18, R19 (DNP): fallback for a 3 V TTL IMU (CV7 or CX5).\nFit both and leave U10 and its caps off. Never fit them with U10 fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.62 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d6ddee67-eda6-4e96-ab05-27251be7dd49")
	)
	(text "U11 IMU load switch\nEN = IMU_SYNC_IN (J5.13, BBB P8.7). R14 pull-down keeps the IMU off until software enables it.\n~{FAULT} = IMU_SYNC_OUT (J5.11, BBB P8.9), open drain, low = overcurrent. R15 pull-up to +3V3.\nR16 = 88.7k 1%: current limit 262 to 342 mA, 300 mA nominal (datasheet Table 9-2).\nTPS2553-1 latches off after 7.5 ms of overcurrent. Software clears it by toggling EN (P8.7) low then high.\nFB1, C32 and D6 protect the harness supply at J2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.8 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "11af393f-2ddd-4be7-bae7-06fc2b85e535")
	)
